1
00:01:37,729 --> 00:01:43,080
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,130 --> 00:01:43,690
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,690 --> 00:01:45,900
[Episode 15]

4
00:01:46,759 --> 00:01:48,840
From the Hound Pit
in the west of the county

5
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,440
to Yulu Pavilion in the east,

6
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:53,430
Xinghua Alley is the only route.

7
00:01:53,430 --> 00:01:55,039
Gong Le knew exactly

8
00:01:55,350 --> 00:01:56,150
when Zhe Shan

9
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,800
came and went every time.

10
00:01:58,479 --> 00:02:00,480
The methods used
in the two throat-crushing cases

11
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:02,230
were remarkably similar.

12
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,640
The Divine Constable Tally is here.

13
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:06,590
Listen carefully, suspects.

14
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:08,080
If you tell the truth now,

15
00:02:08,090 --> 00:02:09,630
you can still keep some dignity.

16
00:02:09,630 --> 00:02:11,350
But if you lie,

17
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:13,030
let's see if your heads are harder

18
00:02:13,030 --> 00:02:14,370
than the execution blade

19
00:02:14,370 --> 00:02:15,900
beside the Shangfang Drum.

20
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:16,980
Sound the drum.

21
00:02:17,430 --> 00:02:18,340
Start the trial!

22
00:02:18,340 --> 00:02:20,550
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

23
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:28,980
Second Master.

24
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:34,240
Although the deceased, Ji Ada, drowned,

25
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,560
the real cause of death

26
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,940
was a beast's teeth crushing his throat.

27
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:40,190
He was murdered.

28
00:02:40,590 --> 00:02:43,150
And the murderer is in this courtyard.

29
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:44,800
Ji Ada

30
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:47,690
was bitten to death by Black Silk Leopard?

31
00:02:49,010 --> 00:02:50,980
And he wasn't the only one.

32
00:02:51,470 --> 00:02:54,130
There was also Zhe Shan,
the guard of Ji Mansion.

33
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:55,800
Zhe Shan?

34
00:02:55,870 --> 00:02:56,550
Wasn't he

35
00:02:56,579 --> 00:02:58,070
bitten to death by the wolf demon

36
00:02:58,070 --> 00:02:59,600
controlled by Xia Jiuying?

37
00:03:00,470 --> 00:03:01,370
The real killer

38
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,840
who put these two to death

39
00:03:03,590 --> 00:03:05,000
is not Xia Jiuying,

40
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:07,000
but someone else.

41
00:03:12,870 --> 00:03:15,630
And those are the young master
of the Gong family,

42
00:03:16,150 --> 00:03:16,960
Gong Le,

43
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:18,800
and

44
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:21,560
Old Madam Gong,

45
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,240
Lady Wang.

46
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,000
I don't understand.

47
00:03:31,150 --> 00:03:32,000
How did these two

48
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,840
make the dog kill?

49
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,310
As far as I know,

50
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:36,780
Black Silk Leopard usually

51
00:03:36,780 --> 00:03:38,280
only takes orders from Gong Sihai.

52
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,910
Lord Situ, do you believe

53
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:42,310
that I can also control
Black Silk Leopard?

54
00:03:42,310 --> 00:03:42,970
Well...

55
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,160
Bring it over.

56
00:03:47,030 --> 00:03:47,910
Pour it in.

57
00:04:11,030 --> 00:04:11,800
Alright.

58
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,560
Lord Situ, please

59
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:16,560
step in front of the dog cage.

60
00:04:42,270 --> 00:04:43,070
What...

61
00:04:43,390 --> 00:04:45,040
What on earth is going on?

62
00:04:45,270 --> 00:04:47,060
Reda, the steward of the Gong Mansion,

63
00:04:47,060 --> 00:04:48,590
lives in this side room.

64
00:04:48,870 --> 00:04:50,240
He loves to drink.

65
00:04:50,270 --> 00:04:52,560
This wine was taken from his room.

66
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:54,870
The deserted courtyard
connected to this backyard

67
00:04:54,870 --> 00:04:55,880
was where Gong Sihai

68
00:04:55,880 --> 00:04:57,600
put Old Madam Gong under house arrest.

69
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:59,240
And the bowl of rice porridge just now

70
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:00,680
was Old Madam Gong's

71
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:02,390
three meals a day.

72
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,810
Lady Wang

73
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,800
used wine

74
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,480
and rice porridge,

75
00:05:07,830 --> 00:05:09,950
two easily accessible things,

76
00:05:10,390 --> 00:05:13,510
to make Black Silk Leopard kill.

77
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:18,040
Mixing the wine and rice porridge?

78
00:05:18,750 --> 00:05:20,200
I... I understand.

79
00:05:20,220 --> 00:05:21,600
Dogs have very sharp noses.

80
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:22,360
Black Silk Leopard

81
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:24,240
hates this scent.

82
00:05:24,260 --> 00:05:26,660
Lady Wang
used the dog's keen sense of smell

83
00:05:26,750 --> 00:05:28,040
to train Black Silk Leopard

84
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,450
to hate

85
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:30,560
this unique scent.

86
00:05:30,830 --> 00:05:32,230
With repeated training

87
00:05:32,260 --> 00:05:33,260
and stimulation,

88
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,630
over time,

89
00:05:34,950 --> 00:05:36,159
once Black Silk Leopard

90
00:05:36,159 --> 00:05:38,240
smells this scent on someone,

91
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:41,300
it will attack on its own.

92
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:46,070
Old Madam Gong was confined
to the mansion all year round.

93
00:05:46,070 --> 00:05:47,590
Naturally, she didn't know

94
00:05:47,590 --> 00:05:48,540
trivial details

95
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:49,680
like boxers using rice water

96
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:51,190
to soak their cloth strips.

97
00:05:51,190 --> 00:05:52,540
But Gong Le,

98
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:54,830
who frequently visited the Hound Pit
to see his friend,

99
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:56,340
noticed it

100
00:05:56,430 --> 00:05:57,750
and kept that in mind.

101
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,510
Every time Zhe Shan won a bout,

102
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:10,830
he would go to Yulu Hall
for some entertainment.

103
00:06:10,830 --> 00:06:12,830
His route took him through Xinghua Alley,

104
00:06:12,830 --> 00:06:14,800
right outside Gong Le's window.

105
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:21,030
He smelled of rice water,

106
00:06:21,190 --> 00:06:23,190
coupled with the stench of alcohol.

107
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:25,500
This undoubtedly made him

108
00:06:25,500 --> 00:06:28,450
a perfect target for Black Silk Leopard.

109
00:07:43,159 --> 00:07:44,430
Setting the dog to kill

110
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,530
and hiding the body on the spot.

111
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:49,240
Mingling is currently in its rainy season.

112
00:07:50,070 --> 00:07:51,950
With just one heavy rain,

113
00:07:52,390 --> 00:07:53,600
Zhe Shan's body

114
00:07:53,870 --> 00:07:55,830
would disappear without a trace

115
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,120
and turn up

116
00:07:57,140 --> 00:07:58,900
in the Yan River 20 li away.

117
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:00,830
But My Lord,

118
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:03,600
my brother

119
00:08:03,630 --> 00:08:05,390
wasn't like those boxers

120
00:08:05,430 --> 00:08:07,000
who have rice water on their hands
every day.

121
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:07,790
How could he

122
00:08:07,820 --> 00:08:10,080
be bitten to death by Black Silk Leopard?

123
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,560
Old Madam Gong

124
00:08:15,950 --> 00:08:17,360
should also have a pair of

125
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,510
agate walnuts.

126
00:08:20,830 --> 00:08:22,960
Just as she used scent to train the dog,

127
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:23,850
she used

128
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:24,910
the unique sound

129
00:08:24,930 --> 00:08:27,160
of the agate walnuts knocking together.

130
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:29,060
She covered Black Silk Leopard's eyes,

131
00:08:29,060 --> 00:08:32,429
knocked the walnuts together,
then attacked it with her hairpin.

132
00:08:32,429 --> 00:08:33,669
After repeating this over and over,

133
00:08:33,669 --> 00:08:35,750
Black Silk Leopard

134
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:38,200
would automatically attack

135
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:40,120
whoever made that sound.

136
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,010
That was

137
00:08:41,030 --> 00:08:43,360
Ji Ada when he was
walking down the street.

138
00:08:46,870 --> 00:08:48,840
The best way for the killer
to destroy the evidence

139
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:50,120
was to throw it

140
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,610
into the vast waters

141
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:53,750
of Cui Lake.

142
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,720
It would be so hard

143
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:00,030
to recover 2 tiny walnuts

144
00:09:00,030 --> 00:09:01,240
from the water.

145
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,600
Without physical evidence,

146
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:03,840
it will be difficult to convict him.

147
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:05,200
Bring up the stone slab!

148
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:13,810
Isn't this

149
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:16,360
the stone slab covering the flood channel?

150
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:19,090
Everyone, look at these marks.

151
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:29,510
After the murders,

152
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:31,790
Gong Le used this crowbar

153
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,960
to pry open the stone slab
over the flood channel

154
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,750
and hide Zhe Shan's and Ji Ada's bodies

155
00:09:35,750 --> 00:09:36,750
inside.

156
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:45,240
This crowbar...

157
00:09:46,270 --> 00:09:47,360
Young Master Gong Le,

158
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:50,090
you left it deliberately in the room,
didn't you?

159
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,410
I had a dog

160
00:10:20,430 --> 00:10:21,790
bite his neck off

161
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:27,090
instead of subjecting him to torture,

162
00:10:27,550 --> 00:10:29,480
flaying him, and eating his flesh.

163
00:10:30,870 --> 00:10:33,080
That was the greatest mercy
I could show him!

164
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:33,910
Gong Le...

165
00:10:34,790 --> 00:10:36,000
Pay for my brother's life!

166
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:36,390
Second Master!

167
00:10:36,390 --> 00:10:38,870
-Pay for my brother's life!
-Second Master, calm down!

168
00:10:38,870 --> 00:10:39,630
Let go!

169
00:10:39,630 --> 00:10:40,440
Let go!

170
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:43,480
Gong Le, are you pleading guilty?

171
00:10:43,630 --> 00:10:45,440
Those two were both killed by me.

172
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,000
As for the method,

173
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:51,030
it was exactly the same as what

174
00:10:51,030 --> 00:10:52,830
the Divine Constable just said.

175
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:54,580
I had to ensure the training was effective

176
00:10:54,580 --> 00:10:55,440
and foolproof.

177
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,150
Zhe Shan

178
00:10:58,870 --> 00:11:01,000
was just a guinea pig.

179
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:03,550
My real targets

180
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:06,870
were the ones who had the Gong family
massacred back then—

181
00:11:06,870 --> 00:11:08,960
Qiu Sihai and Ji Ada!

182
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:10,870
So,

183
00:11:11,390 --> 00:11:12,320
if the Divine Constable Bureau hadn't

184
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,630
captured Qiu Sihai,

185
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:17,010
he would probably have died
by your hands too.

186
00:11:17,750 --> 00:11:18,910
I was just gambling.

187
00:11:20,910 --> 00:11:21,720
Gambling?

188
00:11:22,550 --> 00:11:24,630
If Qiu Sihai dies by my hands,

189
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,550
there will be no witnesses left.

190
00:11:26,550 --> 00:11:28,200
Then the masterminds behind him,

191
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,440
the real culprits,

192
00:11:30,670 --> 00:11:32,200
those high officials and nobles,

193
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:34,390
cannot be uprooted!

194
00:11:35,270 --> 00:11:37,150
And the monstrous injustice
suffered by the Gong family

195
00:11:37,150 --> 00:11:38,910
will never see the light of day!

196
00:11:45,870 --> 00:11:47,030
I bet that

197
00:11:49,770 --> 00:11:52,030
the lords of the Divine Constable Bureau

198
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:54,200
are good officials
who exonerate the innocent,

199
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:57,060
suppress violence, punish evil,
and promote good,

200
00:11:58,000 --> 00:11:59,600
and that you can bring true justice

201
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:01,200
to us innocent people!

202
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:11,670
Divine Constable, what you just said

203
00:12:11,670 --> 00:12:12,570
is all true!

204
00:12:12,590 --> 00:12:14,520
I have nothing to say in my defense!

205
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:16,870
But my grandmother

206
00:12:16,870 --> 00:12:18,390
only followed the method I taught her

207
00:12:18,390 --> 00:12:19,630
to train Black Silk Leopard.

208
00:12:19,630 --> 00:12:20,690
She knew absolutely nothing

209
00:12:20,690 --> 00:12:21,670
about the murder plan.

210
00:12:21,670 --> 00:12:22,960
My Lords, please,

211
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:25,200
considering my grandmother's old age,

212
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:28,550
show mercy!

213
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:42,440
Young Master Gong.

214
00:12:43,750 --> 00:12:46,750
To protect your grandmother,

215
00:12:47,790 --> 00:12:50,050
you chose to take all the blame yourself.

216
00:12:50,150 --> 00:12:52,120
To clear Xia Jiuying's name,

217
00:12:52,750 --> 00:12:54,810
you deliberately kept the evidence.

218
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:57,340
You want to save your grandmother

219
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,750
and Xia Jiuying.

220
00:12:59,870 --> 00:13:02,360
But the only person
you never thought of saving

221
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:03,600
is yourself.

222
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:05,510
I, Gong Le,

223
00:13:07,670 --> 00:13:09,270
have no regrets in this life.

224
00:13:30,790 --> 00:13:31,850
Young Master Gong.

225
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:34,240
Old Madam Gong.

226
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:36,240
This case

227
00:13:36,790 --> 00:13:38,200
is not over yet.

228
00:13:40,790 --> 00:13:41,910
Get up first.

229
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:49,030
Gong Le,

230
00:13:49,240 --> 00:13:50,040
let me ask you.

231
00:13:50,630 --> 00:13:52,040
You killed Ji Ada

232
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:54,330
on the second day of this month, right?

233
00:13:54,390 --> 00:13:55,720
Yes, it was that day.

234
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:58,200
That night,
a fire broke out at the Hound Pit.

235
00:13:58,200 --> 00:13:59,870
Ji Ada was rushing back to his mansion

236
00:13:59,870 --> 00:14:00,960
when I intercepted and killed him.

237
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:02,250
Fire!

238
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:03,550
Put out the fire!

239
00:14:03,550 --> 00:14:04,080
Hurry!

240
00:14:04,100 --> 00:14:04,860
Oh no.

241
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:57,790
That's strange.

242
00:14:58,600 --> 00:15:00,240
You killed him
on the second day of the month,

243
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:01,850
but on the third day,

244
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:03,980
Mr. Ji invited us

245
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:05,510
to drink at Tingchao Boat.

246
00:15:05,630 --> 00:15:06,820
That's impossible.

247
00:15:09,240 --> 00:15:10,210
Could it be that

248
00:15:10,630 --> 00:15:11,600
on that day,

249
00:15:12,480 --> 00:15:14,410
the one who fell from Tingchao Boat

250
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:16,630
was Mr. Ji's ghost?

251
00:15:17,440 --> 00:15:18,360
On the third day,

252
00:15:18,360 --> 00:15:20,030
Ji Ada fell into the sea
from Tingchao Boat.

253
00:15:20,030 --> 00:15:21,270
The four of us saw it with our own eyes.

254
00:15:21,270 --> 00:15:22,440
We couldn't be wrong.

255
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:23,570
That's impossible.

256
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:24,750
I clearly...

257
00:15:24,750 --> 00:15:25,480
Gong Le,

258
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:28,000
are you sure
the person you killed that night

259
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:29,120
was Ji Ada?

260
00:15:43,750 --> 00:15:44,550
That night,

261
00:15:45,200 --> 00:15:46,530
the alley was very dark.

262
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:49,030
I...

263
00:15:49,390 --> 00:15:50,030
I...

264
00:15:50,030 --> 00:15:51,390
You did kill someone.

265
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:53,840
But the one who got killed was not Ji Ada.

266
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:55,120
It was his double,

267
00:15:55,630 --> 00:15:57,200
and this is the corpse.

268
00:16:01,750 --> 00:16:02,600
His double?

269
00:16:08,360 --> 00:16:10,320
What a switch.

270
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:12,000
Am I right,

271
00:16:13,270 --> 00:16:14,200
Mr. Ji?

272
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:19,840
I really don't know

273
00:16:20,200 --> 00:16:21,870
what you are talking about, My Lord.

274
00:16:21,870 --> 00:16:22,960
Mr. Ji?

275
00:16:23,240 --> 00:16:23,870
Well...

276
00:16:23,870 --> 00:16:25,000
My Lord, you mean...

277
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,440
he is Ji Ada?

278
00:16:27,630 --> 00:16:28,440
Ji Ada?

279
00:16:28,760 --> 00:16:30,750
Does that mean the one I killed was...

280
00:16:30,750 --> 00:16:31,550
Ji Er?

281
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:33,720
There was never any Ji Er.

282
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:35,670
From the very beginning,

283
00:16:35,670 --> 00:16:37,000
it was all Ji Ada

284
00:16:37,020 --> 00:16:38,080
using a double

285
00:16:38,100 --> 00:16:39,910
to fool the world!

286
00:16:46,030 --> 00:16:50,000
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

287
00:16:48,510 --> 00:16:49,570
Still pretending?

288
00:16:50,200 --> 00:16:52,300
You colluded with Gong Sihai

289
00:16:52,550 --> 00:16:54,390
to amass a lot of ill-gotten wealth.

290
00:16:54,390 --> 00:16:55,990
You were worried that one day

291
00:16:56,030 --> 00:16:57,200
your crimes would be exposed.

292
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:58,000
So,

293
00:16:58,150 --> 00:16:59,750
you prepared a double.

294
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:01,600
With just a little disguise,

295
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:03,390
he could look exactly like you,

296
00:17:03,610 --> 00:17:04,359
just like

297
00:17:04,750 --> 00:17:06,349
your twin brother.

298
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:08,680
You claimed that Ji Er was in poor health

299
00:17:08,680 --> 00:17:09,400
and usually

300
00:17:09,430 --> 00:17:10,829
never left the house.

301
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:11,970
-So, hardly anyone remembers
-Let's go back, Second Master.

302
00:17:11,970 --> 00:17:13,160
what he looks like.

303
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:14,960
The elder brother
does all kinds of evil things,

304
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:16,000
while the younger

305
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:17,650
-is a good man.
-Go back and rest, Second Master.

306
00:17:17,650 --> 00:17:18,880
That's the impression

307
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:19,920
the Ji brothers

308
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:21,349
have given everyone.

309
00:17:21,589 --> 00:17:23,349
When the Divine Constable Bureau
arrived at the Hound Pit,

310
00:17:23,349 --> 00:17:25,030
you knew you were in big trouble.

311
00:17:25,030 --> 00:17:25,829
So,

312
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:27,829
late at night on the second day,
you disguised yourself as Ji Er

313
00:17:27,829 --> 00:17:29,250
and set the place on fire.

314
00:17:29,680 --> 00:17:30,640
Go, go.

315
00:17:30,750 --> 00:17:31,550
Hurry up and go.

316
00:17:31,550 --> 00:17:33,220
You disguised yourself as Ji Er,

317
00:17:33,220 --> 00:17:35,830
so Ji Er naturally
had to disguise himself as you,

318
00:17:35,830 --> 00:17:36,640
Mr. Ji.

319
00:17:37,310 --> 00:17:38,110
I guess

320
00:17:38,750 --> 00:17:39,550
that night,

321
00:17:39,830 --> 00:17:41,880
you were already prepared

322
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:44,000
to kill your double.

323
00:17:49,260 --> 00:17:50,300
Where did he go?

324
00:17:50,510 --> 00:17:51,310
You, that way!

325
00:17:51,330 --> 00:17:52,450
You two, that way!

326
00:17:52,480 --> 00:17:52,960
Yes!

327
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:53,270
Let's go!

328
00:17:53,270 --> 00:17:54,160
Stop chasing!

329
00:17:55,750 --> 00:17:56,800
S-Stop chasing.

330
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:58,350
Let that child go.

331
00:17:58,350 --> 00:17:59,380
Second Master!

332
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:00,960
You set the fire,

333
00:18:00,960 --> 00:18:02,070
and you let the person go.

334
00:18:02,070 --> 00:18:03,400
Think about
how you're going to explain this

335
00:18:03,400 --> 00:18:05,130
to the Master when you get back!

336
00:18:05,790 --> 00:18:06,790
Stop chasing...

337
00:18:16,680 --> 00:18:17,720
Unfortunately,

338
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:19,480
man proposes, God disposes.

339
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:21,240
You didn't expect

340
00:18:22,750 --> 00:18:23,550
Gong Le

341
00:18:24,030 --> 00:18:26,170
to become the biggest flaw

342
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:27,790
in your entire plan.

343
00:19:53,440 --> 00:19:54,470
Idiot.

344
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:17,480
I couldn't figure it out at first either.

345
00:20:17,480 --> 00:20:19,440
If a crushed throat can kill him,

346
00:20:19,830 --> 00:20:21,400
why use a stone to smash him?

347
00:20:22,230 --> 00:20:25,640
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

348
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:23,510
Gong Le.

349
00:20:24,750 --> 00:20:25,550
I'm afraid

350
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:27,960
you never expected

351
00:20:28,480 --> 00:20:29,510
that the person you went

352
00:20:29,510 --> 00:20:30,830
to such lengths to kill

353
00:20:31,400 --> 00:20:34,060
was actually helping you
carry out the killing.

354
00:20:41,440 --> 00:20:43,100
The man who was Ji Er at the time

355
00:20:43,350 --> 00:20:45,160
and is now Mr. Ji

356
00:20:45,400 --> 00:20:46,260
naturally knew about

357
00:20:46,260 --> 00:20:48,110
Gong Le's plan to move the body by water.

358
00:20:46,410 --> 00:20:51,950
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

359
00:20:48,750 --> 00:20:49,590
He knew

360
00:20:50,200 --> 00:20:52,160
the body
would go from the river to the sea.

361
00:20:52,160 --> 00:20:52,960
So,

362
00:20:53,590 --> 00:20:55,160
he went with the flow.

363
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:57,400
You put on the same clothes

364
00:20:57,400 --> 00:20:58,680
as the double from last night,

365
00:20:58,680 --> 00:21:00,350
threw a big celebration banquet,

366
00:21:00,350 --> 00:21:01,400
and put on a good show

367
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:03,440
of falling into the sea to resist arrest.

368
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:05,030
The purpose was

369
00:21:05,240 --> 00:21:06,190
to make the four of us

370
00:21:06,190 --> 00:21:08,510
witnesses to your death.

371
00:21:24,030 --> 00:21:24,890
Second Master.

372
00:21:25,830 --> 00:21:26,690
Second Master.

373
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:29,090
The medicine is ready, Second Master.

374
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:35,900
Second Master,
it's time for your medicine.

375
00:21:41,830 --> 00:21:43,400
Why are you sweating so much?

376
00:21:43,400 --> 00:21:44,800
Did you have a nightmare?

377
00:21:46,440 --> 00:21:47,370
The medicine...

378
00:21:51,240 --> 00:21:52,100
Second Master!

379
00:21:52,240 --> 00:21:53,100
Second Master!

380
00:21:53,160 --> 00:21:54,000
Second Master!

381
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:55,240
Bad news! Bad news!

382
00:21:56,240 --> 00:21:57,480
B-Bad news.

383
00:21:57,480 --> 00:21:58,680
Something terrible has happened!

384
00:21:58,680 --> 00:22:00,240
Why are you panicking?

385
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:01,000
Master...

386
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:01,790
Master...

387
00:22:02,160 --> 00:22:03,560
Master fell into the sea!

388
00:22:04,790 --> 00:22:06,920
Thus, Ji Ada,

389
00:22:06,920 --> 00:22:08,720
who had done nothing but evil,

390
00:22:08,830 --> 00:22:10,030
finally met his end.

391
00:22:09,900 --> 00:22:12,560
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

392
00:22:10,590 --> 00:22:12,720
Only Ji Er, the good brother,

393
00:22:13,270 --> 00:22:15,510
remained, innocent and blameless.

394
00:22:16,680 --> 00:22:17,980
Your baseless fantasies

395
00:22:17,980 --> 00:22:20,030
and speculations just now

396
00:22:20,030 --> 00:22:21,310
are truly

397
00:22:21,510 --> 00:22:23,110
absurd.

398
00:22:23,680 --> 00:22:26,270
Even if Gong Le killed the wrong person,

399
00:22:26,750 --> 00:22:28,270
that doesn't prove

400
00:22:29,440 --> 00:22:31,070
that the one lying here

401
00:22:32,550 --> 00:22:33,920
is not my brother.

402
00:22:34,270 --> 00:22:36,030
The body is severely decomposed,

403
00:22:36,030 --> 00:22:37,000
and the two possible times of death

404
00:22:37,000 --> 00:22:38,310
are only half a day apart.

405
00:22:38,310 --> 00:22:39,440
It is indeed impossible to determine

406
00:22:39,440 --> 00:22:40,970
that the deceased is Ji Ada.

407
00:22:42,070 --> 00:22:43,240
As for his double,

408
00:22:43,240 --> 00:22:44,970
that is even more nonsensical.

409
00:22:45,310 --> 00:22:46,870
We twin brothers of the Ji family

410
00:22:46,870 --> 00:22:49,240
are the cousins of Princess Ding.

411
00:22:49,310 --> 00:22:51,440
Everyone in Mingling knows this.

412
00:22:51,550 --> 00:22:53,960
My brother and I

413
00:22:55,070 --> 00:22:56,960
were born from the same womb.

414
00:22:57,270 --> 00:22:58,650
It is well-documented

415
00:22:59,030 --> 00:23:00,310
and verifiable.

416
00:23:01,750 --> 00:23:03,350
How can you say it's a fake?

417
00:23:03,510 --> 00:23:05,440
I did ask the bureau

418
00:23:05,480 --> 00:23:06,920
to investigate

419
00:23:06,920 --> 00:23:08,480
you two brothers.

420
00:23:08,750 --> 00:23:10,070
The Ji family originated

421
00:23:10,070 --> 00:23:11,550
in Dinghai, Yuezhou,

422
00:23:11,960 --> 00:23:14,110
and has made a living by fishing
for generations.

423
00:23:14,110 --> 00:23:15,710
In the fifth year of Hongyun,

424
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:17,480
a great plague struck Yuezhou,

425
00:23:17,480 --> 00:23:18,920
and your clan members were scattered.

426
00:23:18,920 --> 00:23:21,640
You two brothers became beggars

427
00:23:21,720 --> 00:23:23,310
and were never heard from again.

428
00:23:23,310 --> 00:23:25,240
The Mingling County Records states

429
00:23:25,240 --> 00:23:26,960
that in the 20th year of Hongyun,

430
00:23:26,960 --> 00:23:29,020
the Ji brothers settled in Mingling.

431
00:23:29,160 --> 00:23:31,350
Later, you reunited with Princess Ding

432
00:23:31,350 --> 00:23:32,610
and made your fortune.

433
00:23:33,960 --> 00:23:35,030
But I guess

434
00:23:35,240 --> 00:23:36,440
the real Ji Er

435
00:23:36,640 --> 00:23:37,900
must have died long ago

436
00:23:37,910 --> 00:23:39,350
during that wandering journey.

437
00:23:39,350 --> 00:23:41,550
The one who settled in Mingling with you

438
00:23:41,640 --> 00:23:43,640
was this double.

439
00:23:43,640 --> 00:23:44,480
Absurd!

440
00:23:48,550 --> 00:23:50,070
What you just said

441
00:23:50,720 --> 00:23:51,350
is nothing but

442
00:23:51,350 --> 00:23:53,160
your speculation.

443
00:23:53,160 --> 00:23:53,830
Fine.

444
00:23:54,880 --> 00:23:56,350
You want evidence?

445
00:23:56,640 --> 00:23:58,350
Then I will give you evidence.

446
00:23:58,880 --> 00:24:00,030
The real Ji Er

447
00:24:00,160 --> 00:24:01,350
is chronically ill,

448
00:24:01,720 --> 00:24:04,050
so he always stays indoors to recuperate.

449
00:24:04,160 --> 00:24:06,420
It's easy for a person to fake an illness.

450
00:24:07,350 --> 00:24:09,270
But if you want to change your complexion

451
00:24:09,270 --> 00:24:10,760
and truly present

452
00:24:10,780 --> 00:24:11,980
a sickly appearance,

453
00:24:12,270 --> 00:24:13,470
it's very difficult.

454
00:24:13,750 --> 00:24:15,880
If you don't believe me,

455
00:24:16,070 --> 00:24:17,640
you can find a doctor

456
00:24:17,960 --> 00:24:19,640
to check my pulse

457
00:24:20,350 --> 00:24:21,480
and see if my illness

458
00:24:21,880 --> 00:24:22,880
is real

459
00:24:23,160 --> 00:24:24,310
or fake.

460
00:24:28,310 --> 00:24:30,160
It only takes one trick
to fake your illness.

461
00:24:30,160 --> 00:24:31,750
It comes and goes

462
00:24:31,750 --> 00:24:33,640
in the snap of a finger.

463
00:24:34,720 --> 00:24:36,030
Ji Er's pulmonary tuberculosis

464
00:24:36,030 --> 00:24:37,920
is caused by cold invading
the Shaoyang meridian.

465
00:24:37,920 --> 00:24:39,460
There is an acupoint in the human body

466
00:24:39,460 --> 00:24:40,270
called Dazhui,

467
00:24:40,270 --> 00:24:41,550
which lies along the Governing Vessel

468
00:24:41,550 --> 00:24:43,950
and governs all the body's yang meridians.

469
00:24:44,350 --> 00:24:45,600
If a needle is used

470
00:24:45,750 --> 00:24:47,030
to seal this acupoint,

471
00:24:47,720 --> 00:24:50,120
the flow of qi and blood
will be obstructed,

472
00:24:50,160 --> 00:24:51,510
producing

473
00:24:51,920 --> 00:24:53,920
the sickly appearance you see here.

474
00:25:36,720 --> 00:25:38,310
Even his lips have turned red.

475
00:25:38,310 --> 00:25:40,030
So you can fake an illness like this?

476
00:25:40,030 --> 00:25:40,830
Ji Ada!

477
00:25:41,030 --> 00:25:42,160
What else do you have to say?

478
00:25:42,070 --> 00:25:45,240
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

479
00:25:43,270 --> 00:25:45,240
Whether I am Ji Er

480
00:25:45,440 --> 00:25:46,920
or Ji Ada,

481
00:25:47,550 --> 00:25:48,830
it doesn't matter.

482
00:25:49,110 --> 00:25:50,270
Divine Constable Li!

483
00:25:50,270 --> 00:25:52,350
You insist that I faked my death
to escape punishment.

484
00:25:52,350 --> 00:25:53,550
Then you must first

485
00:25:53,580 --> 00:25:55,060
convict me of a crime!

486
00:25:55,240 --> 00:25:56,350
Let me ask you!

487
00:25:57,070 --> 00:25:58,960
You said the Ji family
had been reselling government salt.

488
00:25:58,960 --> 00:25:59,600
Besides a few

489
00:25:59,600 --> 00:26:01,110
unfounded confessions,

490
00:26:01,110 --> 00:26:02,350
do you have any solid evidence?

491
00:26:02,350 --> 00:26:04,350
You have to show it to everyone

492
00:26:02,390 --> 00:26:04,270
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

493
00:26:04,350 --> 00:26:07,640
so that I have no choice but to concede,

494
00:26:07,640 --> 00:26:08,550
right?

495
00:26:12,880 --> 00:26:14,920
After the silver needles were pulled out,

496
00:26:14,920 --> 00:26:16,920
your voice became much louder.

497
00:26:17,480 --> 00:26:18,270
Mr. Ji,

498
00:26:18,290 --> 00:26:19,350
that day,

499
00:26:19,550 --> 00:26:21,440
you set fire to your own Hound Pit

500
00:26:21,440 --> 00:26:22,970
and burned it to the ground.

501
00:26:23,350 --> 00:26:24,160
It shouldn't just be

502
00:26:24,160 --> 00:26:26,290
because you wanted to be a good person.

503
00:26:32,030 --> 00:26:32,830
Ji Ada.

504
00:26:32,920 --> 00:26:34,190
We have already found bricks made of salt

505
00:26:34,190 --> 00:26:35,830
in your Hound Pit!

506
00:26:37,750 --> 00:26:38,680
Let me tell you.

507
00:26:39,310 --> 00:26:41,160
It took me a lot of effort to find them.

508
00:26:41,160 --> 00:26:42,560
I almost choked to death!

509
00:26:45,680 --> 00:26:46,830
I didn't expect

510
00:26:47,440 --> 00:26:48,960
you to actually find it.

511
00:26:49,160 --> 00:26:49,960
Yan,

512
00:26:50,310 --> 00:26:51,880
you look careless, but you are actually

513
00:26:51,880 --> 00:26:53,160
meticulous and observant.

514
00:26:53,160 --> 00:26:54,030
Usually, because

515
00:26:54,030 --> 00:26:54,880
you guys are around,

516
00:26:54,880 --> 00:26:56,680
I am too lazy to use my brain.

517
00:26:56,920 --> 00:26:57,720
But when it comes to things

518
00:26:57,720 --> 00:26:59,110
that you can't solve,

519
00:26:59,110 --> 00:26:59,970
I, Yan,

520
00:26:59,990 --> 00:27:01,040
will step forward

521
00:27:01,060 --> 00:27:02,070
and do my part.

522
00:27:02,070 --> 00:27:02,830
As expected,

523
00:27:03,160 --> 00:27:05,240
you hid the account books

524
00:27:05,440 --> 00:27:07,680
for reselling government salt
in the Hound Pit.

525
00:27:07,680 --> 00:27:08,830
You burned down the Hound Pit

526
00:27:08,830 --> 00:27:09,440
just to

527
00:27:09,470 --> 00:27:11,350
destroy the evidence.

528
00:27:11,960 --> 00:27:13,640
How you seized the government salt,

529
00:27:13,640 --> 00:27:15,650
how you sold it,
and how you split the proceeds—

530
00:27:15,650 --> 00:27:16,550
they're

531
00:27:16,550 --> 00:27:17,550
all recorded here

532
00:27:17,680 --> 00:27:19,640
in detail.

533
00:27:19,720 --> 00:27:20,550
Ji Ada,

534
00:27:21,640 --> 00:27:23,270
what else do you have to say?

535
00:27:24,880 --> 00:27:25,680
My Lord.

536
00:27:37,070 --> 00:27:38,790
If it weren't for you little brat

537
00:27:38,790 --> 00:27:39,720
causing trouble

538
00:27:39,730 --> 00:27:40,920
and ruining my plan,

539
00:27:41,240 --> 00:27:42,510
the Divine Constable Bureau

540
00:27:42,510 --> 00:27:44,480
would never have traced it back to me!

541
00:27:44,480 --> 00:27:45,750
But so what?

542
00:27:46,070 --> 00:27:47,800
As long as His Highness Prince Ding

543
00:27:47,800 --> 00:27:49,750
is still a prince of the Great Shi,

544
00:27:50,030 --> 00:27:52,270
and my cousin is still Princess Ding,

545
00:27:52,300 --> 00:27:53,780
what can you rats

546
00:27:53,880 --> 00:27:55,480
do to me?

547
00:27:59,880 --> 00:28:01,880
Even if I die,

548
00:28:02,440 --> 00:28:03,370
the First Prince

549
00:28:03,750 --> 00:28:05,310
will never let you off.

550
00:28:10,030 --> 00:28:11,440
So, Mr. Ji, are you saying

551
00:28:12,750 --> 00:28:14,550
that reselling government salt

552
00:28:15,160 --> 00:28:17,320
was the First Prince's idea?

553
00:28:18,920 --> 00:28:19,750
Nonsense!

554
00:28:21,340 --> 00:28:23,790
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

555
00:28:21,510 --> 00:28:22,920
I never said that.

556
00:28:30,400 --> 00:28:31,160
Ji Ada.

557
00:28:31,160 --> 00:28:31,880
What is it?

558
00:28:39,160 --> 00:28:40,560
-Master.
-Grandmother!

559
00:28:42,110 --> 00:28:42,720
Grandmother!

560
00:28:42,720 --> 00:28:44,640
Master! Master!

561
00:28:44,640 --> 00:28:47,110
-Grandmother! Grandmother!
-Are you alright?

562
00:28:47,110 --> 00:28:48,510
Grandmother? Grandmother?

563
00:28:48,510 --> 00:28:49,480
Master!

564
00:28:58,720 --> 00:28:59,900
My Lord, please see clearly!

565
00:28:59,900 --> 00:29:01,540
I can testify.

566
00:29:01,560 --> 00:29:02,680
It was Master who found someone

567
00:29:02,680 --> 00:29:04,610
to pretend to be the Second Master.

568
00:29:05,510 --> 00:29:08,650
Every word
the Divine Constable said is true.

569
00:29:09,030 --> 00:29:11,160
But I didn't dare to say it.

570
00:29:11,310 --> 00:29:13,760
If I had, I would die.

571
00:29:13,920 --> 00:29:14,750
Oh no.

572
00:29:14,750 --> 00:29:15,610
He's poisoned.

573
00:29:18,160 --> 00:29:19,820
The hairpin must be poisoned.

574
00:29:22,880 --> 00:29:23,900
Master...

575
00:29:32,550 --> 00:29:34,110
He's dead!

576
00:29:35,550 --> 00:29:38,030
Ji Ada is dead!

577
00:29:38,550 --> 00:29:39,790
Ji Ada...

578
00:29:40,310 --> 00:29:41,160
It's karma.

579
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:44,920
It's karma!

580
00:29:45,440 --> 00:29:46,240
Grandmother.

581
00:29:46,640 --> 00:29:47,440
Grandmother?

582
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:55,310
My good grandson...

583
00:29:57,050 --> 00:29:58,160
Good boy...

584
00:30:01,160 --> 00:30:03,070
In my whole life,

585
00:30:04,550 --> 00:30:06,440
the one I let down the most

586
00:30:08,440 --> 00:30:10,310
is you.

587
00:30:22,070 --> 00:30:23,000
Grandmother...

588
00:30:26,750 --> 00:30:27,920
Grandmother!

589
00:30:31,440 --> 00:30:34,340
Don't leave me.

590
00:30:39,550 --> 00:30:40,920
Grandmother.

591
00:30:42,110 --> 00:30:43,480
Grandmother!

592
00:30:42,210 --> 00:30:46,000
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

593
00:31:05,550 --> 00:31:06,310
Move!

594
00:31:12,000 --> 00:31:12,830
Stay here

595
00:31:12,850 --> 00:31:14,650
and wait for our lord's summons.

596
00:31:29,240 --> 00:31:30,030
Jiuying.

597
00:31:31,270 --> 00:31:33,070
I didn't expect we'd meet again.

598
00:31:44,480 --> 00:31:45,270
Xia Jiuying,

599
00:31:45,440 --> 00:31:46,750
you have been acquitted.

600
00:31:46,750 --> 00:31:47,680
Come with me.

601
00:31:50,160 --> 00:31:50,960
Jiuying,

602
00:31:51,310 --> 00:31:52,440
you can go out now.

603
00:31:52,750 --> 00:31:53,750
You can go now.

604
00:31:53,920 --> 00:31:54,750
Let's go.

605
00:31:54,750 --> 00:31:55,510
Go.

606
00:31:58,400 --> 00:31:59,110
Go now.

607
00:31:59,110 --> 00:31:59,750
Come on.

608
00:31:59,920 --> 00:32:00,720
Listen to him.

609
00:32:01,160 --> 00:32:01,810
Hurry up!

610
00:32:02,350 --> 00:32:03,270
Go!

611
00:32:04,920 --> 00:32:05,590
Go!

612
00:32:15,160 --> 00:32:15,830
Bye.

613
00:32:15,830 --> 00:32:16,550
Jiuying!

614
00:32:21,310 --> 00:32:22,640
Remember to think of me.

615
00:32:22,930 --> 00:32:24,010
Jiuying.

616
00:32:24,270 --> 00:32:25,920
If I weren't Gong Le,

617
00:32:26,150 --> 00:32:28,120
would I be like you,

618
00:32:28,550 --> 00:32:30,450
having a Wolfie as a friend?

619
00:32:30,880 --> 00:32:31,680
Hurry up!

620
00:32:32,200 --> 00:32:34,410
Wolfie is my friend.

621
00:32:34,790 --> 00:32:37,650
Gong Le is also my friend.

622
00:32:37,750 --> 00:32:39,960
Wolfie is your friend.

623
00:32:41,270 --> 00:32:43,830
Gong Le is also your friend.

624
00:33:19,240 --> 00:33:20,030
Jiuying.

625
00:33:20,680 --> 00:33:22,810
Are you still wearing the gold pendant

626
00:33:22,880 --> 00:33:24,160
Mr. Ji gave you?

627
00:33:24,790 --> 00:33:26,440
Since we are friends now,

628
00:33:27,880 --> 00:33:29,270
give it to me.
